 "summary": "Two NPN small-signal transistors, made from neighbouring die of one wafer, share a six-lead SOT363 package and no pin between them. Each is rated 40 V collector to emitter and 200 mA collector current. Within the pair, DC gain agrees to 2 % and base-emitter voltage to 2 mV at most, both at 2 mA. It is meant for comparators, current mirrors, and differential or instrumentation amplifiers.",
